==Route 104 (south)==
[[File:Hoenn Route 104 E.png|thumb|Route 104]]

The southern half of {{rt|104|Hoenn}} connects [[Petalburg City]] with [[Petalburg Woods]] to the north and {{rt|105|Hoenn}} to the south. A cottage belonging to [[Mr. Briney]] is located on the south side. This route is a good place to catch a {{p|Marill}}, which can learn any four of the five [[HM]] moves that will be required to finish this game. It will be very useful if you cannot or do not want to teach those HM moves to the Pokémon that you use in battle.

