====The Take-Down====
The tunnel is fairly small, so you will find the thief and his hostage shortly after you step inside. Defeat him, and he gives up the [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]] before fleeing. The old man rushes in to check on his [[Peeko]], and introduces himself as [[Mr. Briney]] before the pair leaves for his cottage near [[Petalburg Woods]].

